(text "VCC and 3V3 both from the XIAO 3V3: the module's logic level follows its supply.\nMISO, SD_CS, TP_INT unused (no SD card; touch is polled).\nBAT+/BAT-: XIAO underside pads, wired to two holes beside the XIAO.\nPins match fpv_config.h FPV_PANEL_CAPTOUCH35." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 76.2 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "de07c06f-95b6-4f34-83f7-5c6addb6d2de"))
